{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lone game developer thought, sipping his cold coffee:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;What if I made a classic noir detective game, but with some twists? A little jazz in the background. A few bad jokes. Maybe throw in some characters with actual feelings, just for fun. Have them go through some real life shit. How about that?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, <i>Man of Nollyn</i> was born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/extras/ac0728fbe3bfb25330a26970a6d49b59.avif?t=1768467046\" width=1560 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all detectives wear fedoras and trench coats. <i>Man of Nollyn\u00a0</i>is the story of young adults who grew up too fast, solving brutal crimes, and making mistakes along the way. You'll be playing as Vin Virosa, a street-borne private eye with a foul mouth and a dark past. Your clients are Katherine and Chloe, two ambitious police officers looking to prove themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/extras/b6824d8096e8f1f5431db0f3b9ee7428.avif?t=1768467046\" width=1536 height=720 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique investigation mechanisms: Bribery &amp; Intimidation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck on something? Need a hint? In <i>Man of Nollyn</i>, you don't get that by asking nicely. Bribe suspects with money, or even shove a gun in their face to discover the truth. Not the noblest act, but hey. What\u2019s the worst that could happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/extras/820dbece2cf949d96eed1eefb8624462.avif?t=1768467046\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling noir-style detective game with sharp wit and biting satire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bribe suspects or intimidate them into spilling their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short answer questions. A real detective wouldn\u2019t just guess, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich jazz soundtrack. Really makes you feel like an actual genius.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3523520?t=1768467046","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/b3693c76f309bfa1d5a36c7c7e9231629bf31a90/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768467046","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/c7d98fa217b340a1dfd7bc1c3fba479cd6490798/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768467046","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/c7d98fa217b340a1dfd7bc1c3fba479cd6490798/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768467046","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game that contains depictions of crime, corpses murder investigations, and suicide. \r\nIncludes: \r\n- scenes of violence\r\n- character deaths\r\n- presence of blood/corpses\r\n- strong language\r\n- mild sexual references"},"demos":[{"appid":3557660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lone game developer thought, sipping his cold coffee:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;What if I made a classic noir detective game, but with some twists? A little jazz in the background. A few bad jokes. Maybe throw in some characters with actual feelings, just for fun. Have them go through some real life shit. How about that?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, <i>Man of Nollyn</i> was born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/extras/ac0728fbe3bfb25330a26970a6d49b59.avif?t=1768467046\" width=1560 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all detectives wear fedoras and trench coats. <i>Man of Nollyn\u00a0</i>is the story of young adults who grew up too fast, solving brutal crimes, and making mistakes along the way. You'll be playing as Vin Virosa, a street-borne private eye with a foul mouth and a dark past. Your clients are Katherine and Chloe, two ambitious police officers looking to prove themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/extras/b6824d8096e8f1f5431db0f3b9ee7428.avif?t=1768467046\" width=1536 height=720 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique investigation mechanisms: Bribery &amp; Intimidation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck on something? Need a hint? In <i>Man of Nollyn</i>, you don't get that by asking nicely. Bribe suspects with money, or even shove a gun in their face to discover the truth. Not the noblest act, but hey. What\u2019s the worst that could happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/extras/820dbece2cf949d96eed1eefb8624462.avif?t=1768467046\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling noir-style detective game with sharp wit and biting satire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bribe suspects or intimidate them into spilling their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short answer questions. A real detective wouldn\u2019t just guess, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich jazz soundtrack. Really makes you feel like an actual genius.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Slater Chae"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/80dbaf0fc960079170deefc8dce4c0f278c53273/header.jpg?t=1768467046","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3523520/421401861/611910bd93ed26f57e1f4de0af982695cb4b158c/1764008790/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764010314","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3523520/421401861/611910bd93ed26f57e1f4de0af982695cb4b158c/1764008790/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764010314","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3523520/421401861/611910bd93ed26f57e1f4de0af982695cb4b158c/1764008790/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764010314","id":257097977,"name":"MoN_Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257097977/41dbad86eb5ffc7c56ebd610b7892a69e5f9b84d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764010314"}],"name":"Man of Nollyn","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Man of Nollyn - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$8.99</span> $6.29 USD","packageid":1243800,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-30% ","price_in_cent